    "sentence_translations": [
      "Giving Grandma a Bag",
      "",
      "Recently, a Taiwanese netizen noticed that grandma's bag was very old, and bought a Louis Vuitton bag for her.",
      "Unexpectedly, this grandma often took the bag to buy groceries and used it to pack household items.",
      "Sometimes she even used it to pack fresh fish.",
      "Grandma said happily: “This bag is really good, and waterproof! It's just a bit heavy.”",
      "This netizen decided not to tell grandma what the bag cost, saying: “Just as long as grandma is happy.”"
    ]
